<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CNA H1 headline shr slightly up, no div.</title>
<headline>CNA H1 headline shr slightly up, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - headline		 5.8	vs    5.5</p>
<p>    - income		   5.6	vs    5.5</p>
<p>    Net income		19.63     vs   18.87</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   23.39     vs   28.88</p>
<p>    Tax			  7.54     vs   10.99</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    1.85     vs    0.17</p>
<p>    Turnover		 703.47     vs  660.70</p>
<p>    Exceptional loss	 6.32     vs   none</p>
<p>Full name: CNA Gallo Ltd (retail)</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said the exceptional items was made up of the costs of restructuring electronic systems, goodwill arising from the purchase of consumer electronic and profit on the sale of properties and copyright.</p>
<p>They said it was company policy to declare dividend at the end of the financial year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
